        "slc_7d8eb9a34e805859fb7cea7b2d9e0f3c57887db6b8367d3c4facfcbc9caae89d"
      ],
      "text": "kata is a durable task ledger for coding agents and humans: agents create, claim, relate, and close issues with evidence via CLI, while humans supervise in a terminal UI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7558ec539179c9b0b5fb17d46dba15625093c92aca35bbcbfbbfb1866c250621",
