        "slc_cd6f8efbee49d81c80f30155e654411a7617333b8fcbe0f5ddb587dbef0d1b01"
      ],
      "text": "The product ships as one Go binary with a CLI, a long-lived daemon, a TUI, and a browser UI served by the daemon with no separate backend."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_00e40100e2d03306aae4a59f12b46d255a26fd1fb10d9dd744ec3f3b94cdeb7f",
