        "slc_cd6f8efbee49d81c80f30155e654411a7617333b8fcbe0f5ddb587dbef0d1b01"
      ],
      "text": "By default issue state lives in a local SQLite database under KATA_HOME; teams can opt into a remote daemon or federation, and a shared daemon can use Postgres via KATA_DSN."
    },
