        "slc_7d8eb9a34e805859fb7cea7b2d9e0f3c57887db6b8367d3c4facfcbc9caae89d"
      ],
      "text": "All reads and writes go through kata's HTTP API; no client opens SQLite or Postgres directly, and a Go app can mount the listener-free service in-process."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_22c69789f13d00e4cc72b49dc5ad28928c01efea182316a37a049d6e99ab22d5",
