        "slc_cd6f8efbee49d81c80f30155e654411a7617333b8fcbe0f5ddb587dbef0d1b01"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI offers agent-oriented ergonomics: stable short refs, --json and --agent output, idempotent creates, semantic-aware search, a claim flow, and predictable failure modes."
    },
