      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_107b8524b5c4c9009aa02a4606722ad2eb2a7688853e7802b668d354a6e67205",
        "slc_25192760c404293ca186f32be37ed51ed0892784943957d40d9c4b5f121ec879"
      ],
      "text": "Projects are bound to workspaces explicitly via a committed .kata.toml, never inferred from the current directory; outside a bound workspace every command except kata init fails with project_not_initialized."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3d3002806729950234aaffc9759ad092cfbd88ac69489d08cef8df52280d327b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "be64daf8afb2185f68de75218f60338efabf7ab1",
          "line_end": 112,
          "line_start": 104,
          "path": "docs/design/architecture.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/docs/design/architecture.md#L104-L112"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_25abe0d2e116de1f9f243dde501f4ac97234ade4d98579d4ef49af6b80feb042"
      ],
      "text": "Workspace identity derives from the normalized git remote URL rather than the filesystem path, so clones resolve to the same project; one git repository attaches to exactly one project."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0069618a1905deb33c4a79b04f7b94e692c96adbd183f122581c028cddf9779a",
