          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 120,
          "line_start": 109,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L109-L120"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_010d4e2a4ee75597d6e6b1b7f2d8be039169d388bc5d47766b021d0b6b9c7b10",
        "slc_cd6f8efbee49d81c80f30155e654411a7617333b8fcbe0f5ddb587dbef0d1b01"
      ],
      "text": "kata uses pure-Go SQLite via modernc.org/sqlite with no CGO, a Huma-based HTTP API over a Unix socket, and claims no runtime dependencies beyond the single binary."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ea2766fb551d3f1dade01d0efad98044e1306d493c4a47acb41a524aee85aab8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 71,
          "line_start": 69,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L69-L71"
        },
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 60,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L60-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_27d5660c007d55d2b8617a2627a9662efb83af61f8771254c4c1834b7aa2d709",
        "slc_beb9903c8ac1f53a8f0a4776b5ed295bd2a73da3c30ebc6ebd67694ec5a47769"
      ],
      "text": "Building from source requires Go 1.27 or later; module-source installs include the CLI, daemon, and TUI but not the compiled browser bundle needed for `kata ui`."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_960e338f85662cc0c11127b6beb4ae253fe01e2900c159e686918c1478ef2d5a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "workflows",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 230,
          "line_start": 228,
