          "line_end": 105,
          "line_start": 100,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L100-L105"
        },
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 224,
          "line_start": 221,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L221-L224"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_33a206a06f9972077f24fc0fa24981eb5a797feaa6ce4d7e11b844c6a5d63734",
        "slc_737b8477b05664a1aadf77ef623d42acb3c46be42bec2b92e01c47445dd5eef8"
      ],
      "text": "kata init --with-agents writes a managed briefing into AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md without overwriting existing content, and --with-codex-hooks installs structured Codex SessionStart hooks in .codex/hooks.json."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7dbb4dd46e57259ad759c2c67680af5cc34dab6e9cfbd95fda4154a0cd21a92f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 126,
          "line_start": 124,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L124-L126"
        },
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "bd2861e5a466b56e1523b89dcba5fa67ee3ba3e1",
          "line_end": 144,
          "line_start": 136,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/README.md#L136-L144"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_084ff3d404f275eded50f1fe759e70ebf57b1913b0a2921db7bfff180ee96e16",
        "slc_b8880c24f1714c05576ae535aa7d5e2c3c6599a7854e63da81d55fee81fe26f1"
      ],
      "text": "kata is intentionally not a project-management suite, git workflow engine, agent worker pool, or SaaS tracker; it does not ride git remotes for sharing, relying on the remote daemon and federation instead."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6535b61aee64a46d6b5d041021467c3238e8df80651fc688e233d709c10108e2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "be64daf8afb2185f68de75218f60338efabf7ab1",
          "line_end": 223,
          "line_start": 216,
          "path": "docs/design/architecture.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/docs/design/architecture.md#L216-L223"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c9ae50c6c3bf852fb1a70f8efca8fb1e4d27b74fd71d3f26195c6d01a323b4d2"
      ],
      "text": "Permanent non-goals include workspace-local behavior overrides, per-issue SSE subscriptions, bulk mutation endpoints, remote webhooks, and a (kata-#N) commit-message convention."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2cb762dd951f0df0bc2aa614f13ca8aa4c7feaf13a95ec1136cdf1683d910641",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "4680ea315daa139d45a0a559d7328a41b94da3d2",
          "line_end": 139,
          "line_start": 135,
          "path": "docs/design/autostart-idle-shutdown.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/docs/design/autostart-idle-shutdown.md#L135-L139"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e9c0eccac019a0d3089aadfaa997233ada6dd8c5c9438b659f31dbb7b601ed1c"
      ],
      "text": "On an idle-enabled auto-start daemon, scheduled work is opportunistic: timers do not keep the process resident, so continuous sync, federation, timed claims, embeddings, or hooks need an explicit service-managed daemon."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_16169b53e2cc0e4832f4a8f9eee939ee0aa5b6f4c8d37ddc2a7e78cae1340972",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "4680ea315daa139d45a0a559d7328a41b94da3d2",
          "line_end": 27,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "docs/design/autostart-idle-shutdown.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/docs/design/autostart-idle-shutdown.md#L23-L27"
        },
        {
          "commit": "f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029",
          "git_sha": "4680ea315daa139d45a0a559d7328a41b94da3d2",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "docs/design/autostart-idle-shutdown.md",
          "repository": "kenn-io/kata",
          "url": "https://github.com/kenn-io/kata/blob/f41a33383aba48941cb94b987124f5cd14840029/docs/design/autostart-idle-shutdown.md#L3-L9"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1d5141f08eb7ddbcc4f6978ce1aa54d90b6cc0ec6514a0459cefd27c449383cc",
        "slc_5da49345e12910118af44d9c894d289fdc7245af03e244ef391c0fd35b54c83c"
      ],
      "text": "Clients auto-start a local daemon when none is reachable; an autostart_idle_timeout lets such a narrowly scoped daemon exit after foreground use stops, while explicit daemons remain long-running."
    }
